      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00517",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "祖父也到了江户。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My grandfather also went to Edo.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00517",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "父亲毕业于东京医科学校。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My father graduated from Tokyo Medical School.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00517",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "该校校长的铜像屹立在汤岛天神宫。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A bronze statue of the school's principal stood at Yushima Tenjin Shrine.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00517",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "到东京头一天，被领到这座铜像前的时候，我惊愕不已。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "On my first day in Tokyo, when I was taken before that bronze statue, I was utterly astonished.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00517",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "铜像的一半竟像是活的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Half of the bronze statue looked as though it were alive.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00517",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "我不好意思眺望它。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I felt too embarrassed to gaze at it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
